  (msg finishAEUpdate[^ CIPHERRESULT] from oid(101, testTa) to testTa)
  < oid(101, testTa) : OperationHandle | oid : oid(1, testTa),
      state : handleState((init, keySet)), opclass : clsAE >
  C .

--- AEEncryptFinal produces ciphertext/tag and resets the top-level handle.
