--- GENERAL-PANIC handles programmer errors against active calls and top-level
--- handles.
search [1] in COMPLETION-TEST :
  < testTa : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(apiCall(CipherUpdate , (handle(oid(101, testTa)),
